>
> is there a way/option to ONLY update notes in a specific sub-deck (vocabulary::chapter-2) and ignore "outside" duplicate notes (in 
> vocabulary::chapter-1), while continuing to create new notes/duplicates in the specified sub-deck (vocabulary::chapter-2) if the notes
> do not exist IN the sub-deck (vocabulary::chapter-2)?
>
>> --- no longer a problem as of update v2.7

a QOL suggestion:
perhaps add an "info" line below "Add Subdeck: " showing the full path of the "sub-deck" (that will be created) would be helpful to others. I made the mistake of creating a sub-sub-deck (i.e. "vocabulary::chapter-1::chapter-2") not understanding that sub-deck didn't mean "first-level" only. (my intention was to create "vocabulary::chapter-2")

thank you for the great plug-in!

