ñ‹Í"îI was having issues when trying to remove cloze from the entire block of text, as it was removing all new line characters. I asked gemini and it suggested to replace "<" with "<=" in this logic
```
      if (remaining <= len) {
        return { node, offset: remaining };
      }
```

Now it works without removing any new lines ğŸ‘

