Cloze Field:
Scope of Audit - Includes
- Cover adequately {{c1::all aspects of an Enterprise}}
- Fin Info is {{c2::Reliable and Sufficient}} > jdgmnt based on {{c2::Study + Assess of A/c sys and IC}} and Carryout {{c2::Test, enquiries and procedures}}
- Info is {{c3::relevant and properly disclosed}} > by ensuring {{c3::Transactions and Events}} are properly summarised and {{c3::Jdgmnts of Mngmnt}} is considered. Auditor to evaluate {{c3::selection and consistent}} application of {{c3::accounting policy}}
- It is based on Historical Fin info

Steps to Reproduce:
